abstract: >-
  A finite named-piece exact-cover model under row-column margins with three
  exactness levels (support, purity, and exact-two-replacement repair), exact
  C32/C46/P49 separation witnesses, and a fixed-parameter theorem in the
  largest-piece residual area. A bounded P21 case study separates fixed-fiber
  connectivity, integral lattice generation, and all-right-hand-side Markov
  connectivity. Classical surrounding results and source specimens are
  attributed; no priority or firstness is claimed.
